# cfn-fleet engine registry (planning/HANDOFF_cfn-fleet-engines.md, section 1)
# Copied into the run dir by fleet init (via fleet_engines_install); until then
# lib/engines.sh falls back to this shipped copy. Edit the run-dir copy to
# tune per-run; edit THIS file to change the fleet-wide defaults.
#
# One engine per line, 7 fields joined by " | " (space pipe space):
#   name | bin | args | set | unset | trust_keys | banner_regex
#   set:         comma list of NAME=$SOURCE_VAR (resolved from the master
#                shell env at spawn time) or NAME=literal
#   unset:       comma list of plain variable names
#   trust_keys:  comma list of keys sent when the folder-trust prompt is seen
#   banner_regex: ERE matched against capture-pane output; unspaced | is
#                regex alternation and allowed
# '#' comments and blank lines are ignored; fields may be empty. A field must
# NOT contain the three-character sequence " | " (that is the separator).
# NO VALUES ON DISK: only variable names and literals that are not secrets.
#
# glm unset list carries the data-system credential vars (Airtable / Attio /
# Postgres / Supabase) as a least-privilege DEFAULT: third-party-provider panes
# never hold live data credentials, matching the gg-projects rule (write code
# for those systems, never access them). Projects that deliberately want a glm
# worker to reach a data system remove the name from their run-dir copy.
claude-sub | claude | --model sonnet --permission-mode bypassPermissions | | ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN,ANTHROPIC_API_KEY,ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL,ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL,ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL,ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL,ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_FABLE_MODEL | Down,Enter | Claude Team|Claude Pro|Claude Max
glm | claude | --model glm-5.3-flash --permission-mode bypassPermissions | ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.z.ai/api/anthropic,ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=$FLEET_ZAI_TOKEN,CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_UNKNOWN_MODEL_WINDOW_ENFORCEMENT=1 | ANTHROPIC_API_KEY,ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL,ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL,ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL,ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_FABLE_MODEL,AIRTABLE_API_KEY,AIRTABLE_TOKEN,ATTIO_API_KEY,DATABASE_URL,POSTGRES_URL,SUPABASE_URL,SUPABASE_ANON_KEY,SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY | Down,Enter | glm-
codex | codex | --sandbox workspace-write --ask-for-approval never | | OPENAI_API_KEY | Enter | provider: openai|OpenAI Codex
